# US presidents: presidential

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:giggly, path: Path.join(__DIR__, "..")},
  {:kino, "~> 0.19"}
  ])
```

## About this notebook

ggplot2's reference page for
[`presidential`](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/presidential.html) has no examples, so
this notebook says only what the page describes and where Giggly stands.

`presidential` gives the terms of 12 US presidents from Eisenhower to Trump: each president's last
name, the dates the term started and ended, and the president's party. Not in Giggly yet: the
`presidential` dataset, and dates on an axis, which its start and end dates need;
`Giggly.Datasets` has ggplot2's `mpg` and R's `mtcars` only.
